{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003289","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003289"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003289","label":"項羽（蕭相國世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"項王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0064"]},{"surface":"項羽","mention_ids":["c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0007","c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0006"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0064","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p004","quote":"項王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p006","quote":"項羽"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p007","quote":"項羽"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003289","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003289","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003289","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji053-004","person_id":"cbr-p003289","surfaces":["項王","項羽"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-053-xiao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p004","quote":"及高祖起為沛公，何常為丞督事。沛公至咸陽，諸將皆爭走金帛財物之府分之，何獨先入收秦丞相御史律令圖書藏之。沛公為漢王，以何為丞相。項王與諸侯屠燒咸陽而去。漢王所以具知天下阸塞，戶口多少，彊弱之處，民所疾苦者，以何具得秦圖書也。何進言韓信，漢王以信為大將軍。語在淮陰侯事中。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p006","quote":"漢三年，漢王與項羽相距京索之間，上數使使勞苦丞相。鮑生謂丞相曰：「王暴衣露蓋，數使使勞苦君者，有疑君心也。為君計，莫若遣君子孫昆弟能勝兵者悉詣軍所，上必益信君。」於是何從其計，漢王大說。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p007","quote":"漢五年，既殺項羽，定天下，論功行封。群臣爭功，歲餘功不決。高祖以蕭何功最盛，封為酇侯，所食邑多。功臣皆曰：「臣等身被堅執銳，多者百餘戰，少者數十合，攻城掠地，大小各有差。今蕭何未嘗有汗馬之勞，徒持文墨議論，不戰，顧反居臣等上，何也？」高帝曰：「諸君知獵乎？」曰：「知之。」「知獵狗乎？」曰：「知之。」高帝曰：「夫獵，追殺獸兔者狗也，而發蹤指示獸處者人也。今諸君徒能得走獸耳，功狗也。至如蕭何，發蹤指示，功人也。且諸君獨以身隨我，多者兩三人。今蕭何舉宗數十人皆隨我，功不可忘也。」群臣皆莫敢言。"}],"rationale":"依明示名與局部丞相、相國及軍事敘事暫接，何字先排疑問詞；秦東陵侯召平不接齊相，未名署稱不補姓名，桀紂為比擬人物不冒稱當時在場。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p004","text":"及高祖起為沛公，何常為丞督事。沛公至咸陽，諸將皆爭走金帛財物之府分之，何獨先入收秦丞相御史律令圖書藏之。沛公為漢王，以何為丞相。項王與諸侯屠燒咸陽而去。漢王所以具知天下阸塞，戶口多少，彊弱之處，民所疾苦者，以何具得秦圖書也。何進言韓信，漢王以信為大將軍。語在淮陰侯事中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"丞相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"秦丞相御史圖書屬秦官署或舊官稱，未當蕭何。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m004-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","pe