漢王與項羽相距京索之間，上數使使勞苦丞相。鮑生謂丞相曰：「王暴衣露蓋，數使使勞苦君者，有疑君心也。為君計，莫若遣君子孫昆弟能勝兵者悉詣軍所，上必益信君。」於是何從其計，漢王大說。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003289","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"鮑生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0061","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"子孫昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m006-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","book_id":"b-shiji-053","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-053-xiao"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p007","text":"漢五年，既殺項羽，定天下，論功行封。群臣爭功，歲餘功不決。高祖以蕭何功最盛，封為酇侯，所食邑多。功臣皆曰：「臣等身被堅執銳，多者百餘戰，少者數十合，攻城掠地，大小各有差。今蕭何未嘗有汗馬之勞，徒持文墨議論，不戰，顧反居臣等上，何也？」高帝曰：「諸君知獵乎？」曰：「知之。」「知獵狗乎？」曰：「知之。」高帝曰：「夫獵，追殺獸兔者狗也，而發蹤指示獸處者人也。今諸君徒能得走獸耳，功狗也。至如蕭何，發蹤指示，功人也。且諸君獨以身隨我，多者兩三人。今蕭何舉宗數十人皆隨我，功不可忘也。」群臣皆莫敢言。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003289","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"功臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0193","start":193,"end":195,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0223","start":223,"end":228,"surface":"舉宗數十人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m007-0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved